## Hook 6 — Check Added Large Files

Prevents accidentally committing files larger than 750KB, matching the project's pre-commit configuration.

**Why it matters for this repo:** The `.pre-commit-config.yaml` already enforces `check-added-large-files` with `--maxkb=750` (excluding `uv.lock`). This hook provides the same guard at write time, catching large files before they even reach the commit stage — particularly relevant given the extensive `docs_src/` directory with 300+ tutorial files.

Add to `.claude/settings.json`:

```json
