Runs relevant tests when test files or their corresponding source/tutorial files are modified.

FastAPI enforces **100% test coverage** in CI, with a 20-second per-test timeout. Tests require `PYTHONPATH=./docs_src` because tutorial tests import directly from `docs_src/`. The `-x` flag stops on first failure for fast feedback. This hook only triggers for files in `tests/` to avoid running the full suite on every source edit.

